      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 12C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>AT THE BEGINNING OF EACH FISCAL YEAR, PUBLIC AGENDA PROVIDES EACH BOARD MEMBER WITH A COPY OF OUR CONFLICT-OF-INTEREST AND CODE-OF-ETHICS POLICIES AND DISCLOSURE FORM, WHICH EACH BOARD MEMBER MUST COMPLETE, SIGN, AND RETURN TO PUBLIC AGENDA. THE CHIEF STRATEGY AND IMPACT OFFICER REVIEWS THE FORMS. ANY CONFLICTS OF INTEREST NOTED ON THE FORM ARE BROUGHT TO THE ATTENTION OF THE BOARD AT ITS FALL MEETING FOR REVIEW. NO DIRECTOR IS PERMITTED TO VOTE ON ANY MATTER UNDER CONSIDERATION AT A BOARD OR COMMITTEE MEETING WHERE THEY HAVE A CONFLICT OF INTEREST. THE MINUTES OF SUCH MEETINGS WILL REFLECT THAT A DISCLOSURE WAS MADE AND THAT THE DIRECTOR WITH THE CONFLICT OF INTEREST ABSTAINED FROM VOTING.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION B, LINE 15A</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE PRESIDENT'S SALARY IS ESTABLISHED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND REVIEWED ANNUALLY. IN DETERMINING THE PRESIDENT'S COMPENSATION, THE BOARD CONSIDERS PERFORMANCE, THE LATEST COST OF LIVING RATE ISSUED BY THE SOCIAL SECURITY ADMINISTRATION, AND THE FINANCIAL HEALTH OF THE ORGANIZATION. THE BOARD CHAIR MAINTAINS WRITTEN DOCUMENTATION WITH RESPECT TO THE SALARY DETERMINATION AND APPROVAL. THE PRESIDENT USES THE SAME PROCESS WHEN DETERMINING COMPENSATION FOR EMPLOYEES ANNUALLY. THE PRESIDENT MAINTAINS WRITTEN DOCUMENTATION WITH RESPECT TO THE SALARY DETERMINATION AND APPROVAL. MEMBERS AND OFFICERS OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DO NOT RECEIVE COMPENSATION.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PART VI, SECTION C, LINE 19</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>PUBLIC AGENDA MAKES ITS GOVERNING DOCUMENTS, CONFLICT OF INTEREST POLICY, AND FINANCIAL STATEMENTS AVAILABLE TO THE PUBLIC UPON REQUEST. THE FEDERAL FORM 990 IS AVAILABLE ON GUIDESTAR.ORG.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
